OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHomes and temples glow across India to
OL,4,Amark Diwali
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough Diwali traditions vary across
OL,7,FIndia's regions and communities, the
OL,8,Ffestival is widely marked by prayers,
OL,9,Ffamily gatherings, the exchange of
OL,10,Fsweets and the lighting of
OL,11,Ffirecrackers.
OL,13,FBut the celebrations come amid growing
OL,14,Fconcerns over air pollution,
OL,15,Fparticularly in northern India.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
